  <entry>
    <title>刘健宇 | 好学优课初中数学教师</title>
    <link href="/2026/04/25/%E5%88%98%E5%81%A5%E5%AE%87/"/>
    <url>/2026/04/25/%E5%88%98%E5%81%A5%E5%AE%87/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="刘健宇">刘健宇</h1><h6 id="好学优课初中数学教师">好学优课初中数学教师</h6><blockquote><p>本词条将随着对刘健宇了解的不断深入持续更新。</p></blockquote><p>刘健宇概述图（发型是骑电动车吹出来的）：</p><p><img src="/img/%E5%88%98%E5%81%A5%E5%AE%87/LPrisoner.png" alt="刘健宇概述图"></p><h2 id="人物简介">人物简介</h2><p>刘健宇，襄阳人，生于襄阳市，高中毕业于襄阳市第五中学，大学毕业于<a href="https://www.ncepu.edu.cn/">华北电力大学</a>。目前为好学优课初中数学教师。</p><h2 id="主要成就">主要成就</h2><p>刘健宇曾在高考物理中连蒙 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span> 道多选序号题，于是，他的丢分从 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span></span></span></span> 分变为了 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">18</span></span></span></span> 分，实现了从 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span></span></span></span> 分到 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">18</span></span></span></span> 分的伟大历史性突破，为他的人生道路奠定了基础。</p><p>他曾在 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">70</span></span></span></span> 分钟内讲完原定课程，随后掏出补充资料；也曾在 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9 \times 10^6 ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span></span></span></span> 内讲完课程，获得学生一片喝彩，至今也没有归还。</p><p>在课堂教学中，刘健宇注重知识跨阶段讲解。例如，在 “一次函数” 的课程中，他讲解了题目的初二普通做法、初三的相似做法，还顺带提了一下微积分。从此，他的课堂上便少不了 “相似”二字。</p><p>不仅如此，我们还在<a href="https://www.noi.cn/">全国青少年信息学奥林匹克竞赛官网</a>上找到了刘健（<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 人）和刘宇（<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span> 人）的获奖记录，虽然没有刘健宇的获奖记录，但可以<s>伪造</s>补充：</p><p><img src="/img/%E5%88%98%E5%81%A5%E5%AE%87/prize.png" alt="获奖记录"></p><h2 id="主要荣誉">主要荣誉</h2><p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">20</span></span></span></span> 世纪出生的人类奖</p><p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">21</span></span></span></span> 世纪还活着的人类奖</p><p>年会啥都没抽中奖</p><p>痨刘拉破车——拖拖拉拉 奖</p><p>搏一搏，单车变木棍 物理高考奖</p><h2 id="语录">语录</h2><blockquote><p>你难道不好奇这题用相似怎么做吗？</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>看我表演。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>听我狡辩。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>我们是…… <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3:50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">50</span></span></span></span> 上的课。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>这题不会的人真的该站起来了。（全班几乎都站起来了）</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>阿基米德好吃。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>不是统考那你受着呗。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>“老师你今天拖堂吗？”</p><p>“拖啊，你还不了解我吗？”</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>这题做完下课。</p></blockquote><script defer src="https://giscus.app/client.js"        data-repo="SigmaDCY/sigmadcy.github.io"        data-repo-id="R_kgDORXS_6Q"        data-category="General"        data-category-id="DIC_kwDORXS_6c4C7poI"        data-mapping="pathname"        data-strict="0"        data-reactions-enabled="1"        data-emit-metadata="0"        data-input-position="bottom"        data-theme="preferred_color_scheme"        data-lang="zh-CN"        crossorigin="anonymous"        async></script]]></content>
    
    
    
